Package: pistar-radio
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: armhf
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Pi-Star native dashboard <noreply@localhost>
Depends: libi2c0, libsamplerate0, libcrypt1, libstdc++6, curl, procps, python3, unzip
Description: Pi-Star radio services in the classic Pi-Star layout
 Pi-Star PS4 builds of MMDVMHost, DMRGateway and the YSF/P25/NXDN/DAPNET/M17
 gateways, the reusable Pi-Star sbin tools and service handlers, systemd
 units for them and a daily host-file update. No PHP. Radio units are not
 enabled on install.
